{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><strong>We Who Rise: Demo</strong></i> is a trial version of the full game, focused on giving you a taste of the challenge and gameplay. In this demo, you can climb up to level 40, experiencing the core mechanics: precise jumps, deadly traps, and constant upward pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo is designed for short but intense sessions, where you can test your reflexes and get a feel for the core movement. It doesn\u2019t include all content, full scoring, or extended progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881850/extras/edbb9584e2e249d2ca4b44b85726216a.avif?t=1754086118\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Demo Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fast-paced climbing with tight controls</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump, dodge traps, and keep moving as you climb higher.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Limited but intense challenge</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Three hearts let you learn from your mistakes. If you fall or stop too long, it's game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A glimpse of the full game</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo is just a small taste. The full game offers more levels, scoring, and extra content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881850/extras/edbb9584e2e249d2ca4b44b85726216a.avif?t=1754086118\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ready to test your r